	val[]: "此存檔依賴已遺失的DLC或MOD ｡ 它們已顯示在下方 ｡ 你可以選擇它來查看詳細資訊 ｡ " #+ The info about the missing dependencies dialog.

	key[]: "missing_dependencies_fatal_error"
	val[]: "此存檔依賴已遺失的DLC或MOD ｡ 你需要解決問題，才能載入此存檔 ｡ " #+ Info shown if the continue operation is blocked because the save depends on some required dlc (e.g. map or vehicle)

