	val[]: "你確定不現在註冊嗎？<br><br>你以後可以通過位於桌面的 線上服務 選項，打開連接視窗 ｡ " #+ The text displayed in the connect content screen exit confirmation. This is only available when the connect content was displayed automatically when new DLC was detected and has to contain information where to find the screen again later.

